      "demiHuman_ef": "100",
      "demon_ef": "100",
      "description": "<ul><li><p>At the start of your turn, you lose 50% of your current HP. This damage cannot be reduced or prevented.</p></li><li><p>While in <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-id=\"GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Crisis</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>You have&nbsp;<strong>resistance</strong>&nbsp;to all type of damage.</p></li></ul><hr contenteditable=\"false\"><p><strong>【Set Bonus】</strong></p><p><strong>2-Piece</strong></p><ul><li><p>Deals <strong>5</strong> extra damage if you are in <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-id=\"GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Crisis</strong></a></p></li></ul><hr contenteditable=\"false\"><p><strong>3-Piece</strong></p><ul><li><p>Reduce damage dealt to you by <strong>5&nbsp;</strong>if you are in <a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-id=\"GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\"><strong>Crisis</strong></a></p></li></ul><hr contenteditable=\"false\"><p><strong>4-Piece</strong></p><ul><li><p>When your HP is reduce to 0. You may choose to persist at 1 HP, this ability can only trigger once per scene.</p><hr contenteditable=\"false\"></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
